{"about_the_game":"Necromancer Returns is a turn-based strategy game in which you assemble an army and fight hordes of enemies. Peace in a fantasy kingdom has been shattered by the return of the Necromancer \u2013 a creature of darkness that wishes to enslave all living beings. Assemble the best warriors from all over the kingdom and achieve victory in an epic conflict.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/632020/extras/139d4b7c97e7e3cd86ef503c967f89ff.poster.avif?t=1726402716\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/632020/extras/139d4b7c97e7e3cd86ef503c967f89ff.webm?t=1726402716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/632020/extras/139d4b7c97e7e3cd86ef503c967f89ff.mp4?t=1726402716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In the Necromancer Returns world, you travel alongside the princess of the kingdom, exploring new lands and fighting a variety of opponents, some of which may decide to join your army. Every creature possesses special skills, opening up opportunities for various battle tactics.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/632020/extras/c57fe44f5a7d6102a5164c1230f0f6cc.poster.avif?t=1726402716\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/632020/extras/c57fe44f5a7d6102a5164c1230f0f6cc.webm?t=1726402716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/632020/extras/c57fe44f5a7d6102a5164c1230f0f6cc.mp4?t=1726402716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2>\u2022 An exciting campaign plot that takes you through varied areas<br><br>\u2022 Turn-based combat system<br>\u2022 Over 20 varied characters that can be upgraded<br>\u2022 Hero leveling and skill tree<br>\u2022 Numerous artifacts with unique properties and a spellbook<br>\u2022 Highly detailed character models and game locations<br>\u2022 Bonus quests, dungeons and endless arenas<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/632020/extras/7561ea720e6359690f6dba17ae152565.poster.avif?t=1726402716\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/632020/extras/7561ea720e6359690f6dba17ae152565.webm?t=1726402716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/632020/extras/7561ea720e6359690f6dba17ae152565.mp4?t=1726402716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"320d2de1a0e3bf6872908a21e94debaf70f268a0.jpg","localized_name":"Will come in handy","name":"Will come in handy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/632020/320d2de1a0e3bf6872908a21e94debaf70f268a0.jpg"},{"icon":"8a810fed54d4c83644879f6d82b46dfc22b0bfd2.jpg","localized_name":"Rookie","name":"Rookie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/632020/8a810fed54d4c83644879f6d82b46dfc22b0bfd2.jpg"},{"icon":"4ef798b785c8841f498ae16cda48c6a1082c6aec.jpg","localized_name":"Skilled warrior","name":"Skilled warrior","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/632020/4ef798b785c8841f498ae16cda48c6a1082c6aec.jpg"},{"icon":"b861bcb6f96d0566f2fc3c2931da47524fb440d8.jpg","localized_name":"Warlord","name":"Warlord","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/632020/b861bcb6f96d0566f2fc3c2931da47524fb440d8.jpg"},{"icon":"cf285fd9ff106b18afbbd5a81b9619e8a6f33bb9.jpg","l